sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Dashboard
    participant API
    participant DB
    
    User->>Dashboard: Enter credentials
    Dashboard->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>DB: Query user by username
    DB-->>API: User record
    API->>API: Verify password (bcrypt)
    API->>API: Generate JWT token
    API-->>Dashboard: JWT token
    Dashboard->>Dashboard: Store token
    
    User->>Dashboard: Access protected resource
    Dashboard->>API: GET /api/resource<br/>Authorization: Bearer <token>
    API->>API: Validate JWT signature
    API->>API: Check token expiration
    API->>API: Extract user role
    API-->>Dashboard: Resource data
